From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ken Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 17:44:47 -0700
Subject: GL: reset base level to 0 for ASTC uploads on PowerVR.

Add workaround which resets the base level of the destination texture
while performing TexSubImage2D uploads of ASTC data. Apply this
workaround on Imagination's GLES drivers.

Add a new test which both catches the crash bug on Pixel 10 as well as
verifies rendering from the ASTC-uploaded texture.

Co-authored with Gemini. [agy]

CONV: b6f783ec-ad2a-4e4b-95c8-86d2fe49e5ee
